{"id":"rayon","lemma":"rayon","pos":"noun","rank":1797,"glosses":["ray, beam (of light, etc.)","spoke (of wheel)","radius"],"ipa":"/ʁɛ.jɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/Fr-rayon.ogg/Fr-rayon.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rayons"},"formAudio":{"rayons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-rayons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Remets-le en rayon.","en":"Put it back on the shelf.","words":[{"g":"to put back, replace","l":"remettre"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Les rayons des magasins sont vides.","en":"The store shelves are empty.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"shop, store","l":"magasin"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"empty","l":"vide"}]},{"text":"Un rayon de soleil traversait les nuages.","en":"A beam of sunlight came through the clouds.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"to cross, to go across","l":"traverser"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"cloud","l":"nuage"}]},{"text":"Les rayons ultraviolets nous sont nuisibles.","en":"Ultraviolet rays are harmful to us.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"ultraviolet","l":"ultraviolet"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"harmful","l":"nuisible"}]},{"text":"Son chef de rayon lui donna un conseil en or.","en":"His supervisor gave him a sterling recommendation.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"boss, chief"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"piece of advice"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"golden"]]}]}